I finish the conversation with my friends.
I say to Amit, Neha, and Sanjay, "Good night, see you again!"
They also bid me good night.
Then I go to the nearby bus stop.
In a short time, my regular BEST bus arrives.
I board the bus.
I give rupees to the conductor and buy a ticket.
I sit near the window and look outside.
There is a lot of crowd on the road in Mumbai.
But today, the past days are on my mind.
I came here in January.
On the first day, I met Asha.
She helped me a lot.
After that, I went to the office for the first time.
There I met Rohan.
He also helped a lot.
In the beginning, I did not know anything about the city.
Now I have many friends here.
Thinking of all this, I become happy.
